ledger: C5
expect: fail
reason: Lacci's Image has no path= (C5 rules path an alias of url).
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @logo = image "assets/red-40x30.png"
end
----------- test code
logo = image("@logo")
logo.path = "assets/checker-20x20.png"
assert_equal "assets/checker-20x20.png", logo.path, "path = swaps in the new file"
